### PR 1135: #1040: Livewire public properties no longer carry full model lists
## Closes #1040

**Closes #1040.**

## What this PR is

`units/index`, `users/index` and `tickets/⚡inbox` held the operator's whole
option universe in **public Livewire properties**. Under the framework's
dehydrate/hydrate contract —
**Livewire 4 carries models/collections in the snapshot as just their identifier
